<title>USA: Catalyst Int'l names financial officer.</title>
<headline>Catalyst Int'l names financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalyst International Inc, which makes warehouse management software, said Wednesday that Tom Hickinbotham has been named vice president, finance and administration and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Lisa Sanregret, who has left the company. No reason was given.</p>
<p>Hickinbotham has more than 10 years of experience as a financial officer.</p>
<p>			((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
